WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.760
- [Dominique] If you
brought your heels with you,

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.050
please put them on.

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.910
Five, six,

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.488
seven, eight, walk.

00:00:06.488 --> 00:00:07.570
- Hey, how are you?

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:09.430
- I didn't even know what trans was.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.400
It was always, you're not a girl.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.203
Things did not feel right.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.630
The voice came back to me, run.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.380
When I first put on
that hair and I realized

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:23.990
that I could be me,
there was no going back.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.300
- What were the shows like?

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.950
- Ballroom saved my life.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.483
You just can't give up.

00:00:28.483 --> 00:00:30.852
(upbeat music)

